 again\\n\"\n│                    └──────────────┘ └─────────────────────┘\n│"},{"step":"hashes","title":"Commit two’s id depends on every object it reaches","line":"6 of 80 digits match in place, about the 5 chance gives.","caption":"Commit two’s bytes hold its tree’s id and its parent’s id, so its id depends on everything it reaches. Of the 80 digits in the new tree and commit ids, 6 are the same digit in the same place as in the old ids, about the 5 that chance alone gives: SHA-1 changes everywhere. A test checks every id against git hash-object.","start":69.833,"end":93.1,"hold":74.833,"state":{"hello":"ce013625030ba8dba906f756967f9e9ca394464a","t1":"aaa96ced2d9a1c8e72c56b253a0e2fe78393feb7","c1":"161f3920c6abe4771d81f05869e2b962752044f9","nextBlob":"13ab7f7412573d479aa8b41ce1e29a9f9f2a62d5","t2":"a3424b7ffd6239c4903761039739ac2f641d9ca0","c2":"dfef583758597f177366effbb64f7176e5917b74","shared":false,"head":"dfef583758597f177366effbb64f7176e5917b74","walks":[{"step":"commit","from":"Main","to":"C1","edge":"edge:Main->C1#0"},{"step":"commit","from":"C1","to":"T1","edge":"edge:C1->T1#0"},{"step":"commit","from":"T1","to":"Hello","edge":"edge:T1->Hello#0"},{"step":"head","from":"HEAD","to":"Main","edge":"edge:HEAD->Main#0"},{"step":"head","from":"Main","to":"C2","edge":"edge:Main->C2#0"},{"step":"head","from":"C2","to":"T2","edge":"edge:C2->T2#0"},{"step":"head","from":"T2","to":"New","edge":"edge:T2->New#0"}]},"changed":{"nextBlob":{"after":"13ab7f7412573d479aa8b41ce1e29a9f9f2a62d5"},"t2":{"after":"a3424b7ffd6239c4903761039739ac2f641d9ca0"},"c2":{"after":"dfef583758597f177366effbb64f7176e5917b74"},"shared":{"after":false}},"picture":"Flowchart: 8 nodes, 7 links; Code, 6 lines; Tree one’s id aaa96ced2d9a1c8e72c56b253a0e2fe78393feb7 and commit one’s id 161f3920c6abe4771d81f05869e2b962752044f9, each with a line left under it for the id that replaced it; Tree two’s id a3424b7ffd6239c4903761039739ac2f641d9ca0 under tree one’s, and commit two’s id dfef583758597f177366ef